      "message": "Note that I don\u0027t think this will be caught by [`-ftrapv`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/fpmcu/CMakeLists.txt;l\u003d9-10;drc\u003d93efde27eca7db72ce31133c5e9382ae31315b4d) since it\u0027s unsigned overflow.",
